    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Definition'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/Foodora/workbooks/PrivateLabelMarketingDashboard/Definition?rev=' id='Definition' path='/t/Foodora/workbooks/PrivateLabelMarketingDashboard' revision='' site='Foodora' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='800' maxwidth='1000' minheight='800' minwidth='1000' />
      <zones>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='40375' id='3' type-v2='text' w='96900' x='1000' y='1250'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial Rounded MT Bold' fontsize='14'>Customer Segments</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>

This section of the dashboard looks at users at the brand level. 

1. </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>Prospects</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'> are Dmart active users who have yet to purchase from the given Private Label brand before. In each time period, for a given country and Private Label brand, the number of Prospects represents the number of Dmart users who made at least 1 Dmart order in the given period, but have never ordered from the brand before. 

2. </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>Acquired</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'> are new users who purchased from the given Private Label brand for the first time in the given time period. 
- Note that if a user made more than 1 orders from the Private Label brand in a given time period, and the first order made was completed as an Acquired user while the second order made was completed as an Active user, then the user is considered Acquired in the given time period. 

3. </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>Active </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>are existing users who purchased from the given Private Label brand before and reordered from the brand again within 30 days. 

4. </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>Churning</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'> are existing users who purchased from the given Private Label brand before and their last purchase was made more than or equal to 31 days ago but less than or equal to 180 days ago. For each time period, the number of Churning users refers to the number of existing Private Label brand users (</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' italic='true'>since the brand was first launched</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>) whose last order was made more than or equal to 31 days ago but less than or equal to 180 days ago. 
- Note that the reference date used to calculate the number of days between a user&apos;s last order is based on the last date of each given time period i.e. last day of M-1, M-2, etc. or current day for MTD. 

5. </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>Inactive</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'> are existing users who purchased from the given Private Label brand before and their last purchase was made more than 180 days ago. For each time period, the number of Inactive users refers to the number of existing Private Label brand users (</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' italic='true'>since the brand was first launched</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>) whose last order was made more than 180 days ago. 

</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='4' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='5125' id='4' type-v2='text' w='97200' x='1100' y='42750'>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='0' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#e6e6e6' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='38250' id='5' type-v2='text' w='97500' x='1000' y='48750'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial Rounded MT Bold' fontsize='14'>OKR Definitions</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>&#10;&#10;1. </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>PL Brand GFV Share:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'> Percentage of the </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>Private Label Brand GFV</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'> out of </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>Dmart GFV</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'> for all Master Category 3 levels that the Private Label Brand exists in

2. </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>PL Brand &amp; Master Category 3 GFV Share:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'> Percentage of the </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>Private Label Brand Master Category 3 GFV</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'> out of </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>Dmart GFV</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'> for the corresponding Master Category 3 level that the Private Label Brand exists in

3. </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>Average Brand Order Value: </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Average amount in Eur spent per order for the Private Label brand 

4. </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>PL Brand User Penetration:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'> Number of users who ordered from the Private Label Brand out of Dmart users who ordered from all Master Category 3 levels that the Private Label Brand exists in 

5. </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>PL Brand &amp; Master Category 3 User Penetration:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'> Number of users who ordered from the Private Label Brand Master Category 3 out of Dmart users who ordered from all Master Category 3 levels that Private Label Brand exists in 

6. </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>PL Brand User Retention Rate:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'> Percentage of users who bought from the Private Label Brand within </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>30 days</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'> from their previous order in the previous period out of all users who bought from the Private Label Brand in the previous period 

7. </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>PL Brand &amp; Master Category 3 User Retention Rate:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'> Percentage of users who bought from the Private Label Brand &amp; Master Category 3 within 30 days from their previous order in the previous period out of all users who bought from the Private Label Brand in the previous period</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='4' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='97' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone h='98000' id='96' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='1000'>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='40375' id='3' type-v2='text' w='96900' x='1000' y='1250'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial Rounded MT Bold' fontsize='14'>Customer Segments</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>

This section of the dashboard looks at users at the brand level. 

1. </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>Prospects</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'> are Dmart active users who have yet to purchase from the given Private Label brand before. In each time period, for a given country and Private Label brand, the number of Prospects represents the number of Dmart users who made at least 1 Dmart order in the given period, but have never ordered from the brand before. 

2. </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>Acquired</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'> are new users who purchased from the given Private Label brand for the first time in the given time period. 
- Note that if a user made more than 1 orders from the Private Label brand in a given time period, and the first order made was completed as an Acquired user while the second order made was completed as an Active user, then the user is considered Acquired in the given time period. 

3. </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>Active </run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>are existing users who purchased from the given Private Label brand before and reordered from the brand again within 30 days. 

4. </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>Churning</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'> are existing users who purchased from the given Private Label brand before and their last purchase was made more than or equal to 31 days ago but less than or equal to 180 days ago. For each time period, the number of Churning users refers to the number of existing Private Label brand users (</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' italic='true'>since the brand was first launched</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>) whose last order was made more than or equal to 31 days ago but less than or equal to 180 days ago. 
- Note that the reference date used to calculate the number of days between a user&apos;s last order is based on the last date of each given time period i.e. last day of M-1, M-2, etc. or current day for MTD. 

5. </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>Inactive</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'> are existing users who purchased from the given Private Label brand before and their last purchase was made more than 180 days ago. For each time period, the number of Inactive users refers to the number of existing Private Label brand users (</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' italic='true'>since the brand was first launched</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>) whose last order was made more than 180 days ago. 

</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='5125' id='4' type-v2='text' w='97200' x='1100' y='42750'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#e6e6e6' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='38250' id='5' type-v2='text' w='97500' x='1000' y='48750'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial Rounded MT Bold' fontsize='14'>OKR Definitions</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>&#10;&#10;1. </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>PL Brand GFV Share:</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'> Percentage of the </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>Private Label Brand GFV</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'> out of </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>Dmart GFV</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'> for all Master Category 3 levels that the Private Label Brand exists in

2. </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>PL Brand &amp; Master Category 3 GFV Share:</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'> Percentage of the </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>Private Label Brand Master Category 3 GFV</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'> out of </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>Dmart GFV</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'> for the corresponding Master Category 3 level that the Private Label Brand exists in

3. </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>Average Brand Order Value: </run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>Average amount in Eur spent per order for the Private Label brand 

4. </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>PL Brand User Penetration:</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'> Number of users who ordered from the Private Label Brand out of Dmart users who ordered from all Master Category 3 levels that the Private Label Brand exists in 

5. </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>PL Brand &amp; Master Category 3 User Penetration:</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'> Number of users who ordered from the Private Label Brand Master Category 3 out of Dmart users who ordered from all Master Category 3 levels that Private Label Brand exists in 

6. </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>PL Brand User Retention Rate:</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'> Percentage of users who bought from the Private Label Brand within </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>30 days</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'> from their previous order in the previous period out of all users who bought from the Private Label Brand in the previous period 

7. </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>PL Brand &amp; Master Category 3 User Retention Rate:</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'> Percentage of users who bought from the Private Label Brand &amp; Master Category 3 within 30 days from their previous order in the previous period out of all users who bought from the Private Label Brand in the previous period</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
      <simple-id uuid='{9AD9FFF8-3B53-4EC8-BF38-F2F9A99E4017}' />
    </dashboard>
